<p style="<%= email_eyebrow_style %>">ACCOUNT SECURITY</p>
<h1 style="<%= email_heading_style %>">Your password has changed</h1>

<p style="<%= email_text_style %>">The password on your Tariffik account (<strong><%= @resource.email %></strong>) was just changed.</p>

<p style="<%= email_text_style %>">If that was you, there is nothing to do.</p>

<hr style="<%= email_rule_style %>">

<p style="<%= email_muted_style %>">If it was not you, reset your password straight away at
<a href="<%= new_password_url(@resource) %>" style="<%= email_link_style %>"><%= new_password_url(@resource) %></a></p>
